{"message":"Thank you for confirming. The Blue card activity is inconsistent with your location, so I can’t unlock that card. I recommend permanently closing it and issuing a replacement, and changing your online-banking password. The Light Blue card has a security hold and your uncertainty about the ATM attempts means it also requires security-team review before any action.

The Green and Evergreen attempts appear consistent with your confirmations, but I still can’t unlock them until the required review is completed because all four cards were locked together.

To protect you, please confirm these three items:\n1. Do you still have the physical Blue card ending in 5827 and Light Blue card ending in 4518?\n2. Do you believe either card’s PIN may have been compromised—shared with someone, observed, or skimmed? (yes/no/unsure)\n3. Do you authorize me to close the Blue card as suspected fraud and begin a dispute for the declined Tijuana ATM attempts, and would you like me to transfer the Light Blue card to the security team for investigation?"}

